---
import LandingLayout from "../../../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
---

<LandingLayout title="Compare Cadenza Studio | Cadenza Studio" description="See how Cadenza Studio compares to other studio management tools and scheduling apps.">


  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/cadenza" class="nav-logo">
        <img src="/images/cadenza/logo-placeholder.svg" alt="Cadenza Studio Logo">
        Cadenza Studio
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/cadenza/features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/solutions" class="nav-link">Solutions</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/blog" class="nav-link">Blog</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/compare" class="nav-link">Compare</a>
        <a href="/cadenza/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        
        <a href="/cadenza-app" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      </div>
      <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle menu">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="mobile-menu">
    <a href="/cadenza/features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/solutions" class="nav-link">Solutions</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/blog" class="nav-link">Blog</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/compare" class="nav-link">Compare</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
    <a href="/cadenza/contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>How Cadenza Studio compares</h1>
      <p>Thinking about switching? See exactly what changes, including the one thing none of these tools offer: local AI that's actually free, because it doesn't cost us anything to run it on your machine instead of ours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison Cards -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. MyMusicStaff</h3>
          <p>Same core job, modern execution: a real free plan, student portals, local AI transcription and search, and remote access for every family you connect, all free, with no subscription until you need to link your studio to another one beyond your own network.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. Fons</h3>
          <p>Fons focuses on billing automation and charges monthly for it. Cadenza's billing, portals, and local AI are free; the only paid tier is for linking multiple teachers' studios together.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. TutorBird</h3>
          <p>Everything TutorBird does, plus student portals, gamification, resource sharing, and local AI TutorBird doesn't offer.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. Music Teacher's Helper</h3>
          <p>A more modern take on the same job, with a genuinely usable free plan and AI features baked in, not bolted on.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. Duet Partner</h3>
          <p>Free to start with scheduling, portals, and local AI; Premium adds studio-to-studio networking, not basic features.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. Spreadsheets & Paper</h3>
          <p>Replace the spreadsheet and the paper calendar with something that also transcribes your lessons and finds your sheet music, running on the same computer, for free.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="feature-card">
          <h3>vs. Calendly</h3>
          <p>Calendly schedules meetings. Cadenza schedules a studio: recurring lessons, student records, portals, billing, and local AI, together.</p>
          <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem;">Compare features →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Teachers Choose -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="badge">Why teachers choose Cadenza Studio</div>
        <h2>Built specifically for music teachers</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🎁</div>
          <h4>Real Free Plan</h4>
          <p>Full scheduling, messaging, portals, and local AI. No trial clock running out.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🎵</div>
          <h4>Built for Music, Not Adapted to It</h4>
          <p>Practice gamification, portals, and transposition aren't a generic scheduler with music branding bolted on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🎯</div>
          <h4>Built for Engagement</h4>
          <p>Portals and streaks are built to make a student want to check in, not just a place to store their schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🔓</div>
          <h4>Free Core, Honest Premium</h4>
          <p>Scheduling, billing, portals, and local AI: free forever, because they run on your machine. Premium exists for one reason: linking your studio to another teacher's, and we tell you exactly why.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to simplify your music studio?</h2>
      <p>Join teachers who are saving time and growing their studios with Cadenza Studio.</p>
      <a href="/cadenza-app" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Get Started Free</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <a href="/cadenza" class="nav-logo">
            <img src="/images/cadenza/logo-placeholder.svg" alt="Cadenza Studio Logo">
            Cadenza Studio
          </a>
          <p>The complete studio management platform for music teachers.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;"><a href="/curator" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">Built on Curator</a>, open, local-first AI for education.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Product</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/features">Features</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/pricing">Pricing</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/compare">Compare</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Company</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/about">About</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Legal</h4>
          <a href="/cadenza/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Cadenza Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/jeremysheeshka/Cadenza-Studio-App" class="social-link" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  

</LandingLayout>
